[5] WHAT THIS RUN FAILS TO CLOSE (item (b)).
    (BAND-EQ) is NOT proved.  After LEMMA BAND-POS the residue is exactly:
      at every band-carrying gap-1 parent of a head-block run, either i0 = 1, or
      i0 = d+2 AND A[d+2] = c-1.
    Measured on the family: 100 of 100 parents take the i0=d+2, A[d+2]=c-1 branch;
    0 take the i0=1 branch.  Neither branch is PROVED to be the one the family takes.
    LEMMA BAND-POS is a general lemma and does NOT use any family hypothesis, so it
    cannot distinguish the family from the u>=1 counterexamples found in block [3].
